":""},"say:17:1320612015:1":{"text":"なのに、私の勝手な願いのせいで、兄にこんな代償を背負わせていたなんて……ずっと、魂が引き裂かれるほどの苦痛に耐えていたなんて！","source_cn":"我不知道为了满足自私的愿望，哥哥要付出这么大代价……不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CBAC8B64A08B5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320612016:1":{"text":"だから、ありがとうございます。そしてどうか……私が罪を償う手助けをしてくれませんか？","source_cn":"所以我感激，并且恳求你们……求你们帮我赎清这么多年的罪孽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154E795A6CF90323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320612017:1":{"text":"どうか兄を……安からかに眠らせてやってください。","source_cn":"请帮哥哥他……获得安息吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8397B2B986888ECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1320612017":{"text":"どうか兄を……安からかに眠らせてやってください。","source_cn":"请帮哥哥他……获得安息吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8397B2B986888ECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320612019:1":{"text":"機械の体に施された縛霊魔法を解除すれば、ゴーランの魂は解放される。","source_cn":"想让铐兰的灵魂重获平静，需要想办法解开施加在机械躯体上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDE7470068C5C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320612020:1":{"text":"だがそれ